    </table></div></div>
  
  <h2 id="model-card-openai-gpt-56-sol-regional-availability">Regional Availability</h2>
  <p><b><u>Regional availability at a glance</u></b></p>
  <p>Amazon Bedrock offers three inference options: <b>In-Region</b> keeps requests within a single Region for strict compliance, <b>Geo Cross-Region</b> routes across Regions within a geography (such as US, EU, and APAC) while respecting data residency, and <b>Global Cross-Region</b> routes anywhere worldwide when there are no residency constraints. Refer to the <a href="./models-region-compatibility.html">Regional availability by models</a> page for more details.</p>
  <p>Availability differs by endpoint.</p>
  <p><b>Availability using the <code class="code">bedrock-mantle</code> endpoint</b></p>
